legend [shape=plaintext, fontsize=11, label="Saved standing condition | Selected left knee motor/afferent circuits and incoming boundary references.\nArrow: saved excitatory category. Open circle: saved inhibitory category.\nNeuron colours: RG blue; PF green; motor salmon; afferent purple.\nDashed pentagons: boundary references, not additional neurons.\nEdge numbers: gmax (uS). Full fields and IDs accompany each panel."];
